[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    489[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // so `dist -= rA+rB` and the witnesses are pushed out along `c2Norm(b-a)`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    490[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     let l = libs();
