[38;5;252m[1m## Three findings worth noting[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m1. NaN payload bits are not part of the C's behaviour.[22m Initial strict bit comparison flagged 29 mismatches, all NaN-vs-NaN sign-bit differences. Compiling the exact [38;5;10mc2Dot[0m expression [38;5;10ma.x*b.x + a.y*b.y[0m with opposite-signed NaN inputs gives [38;5;10m0x7fc00000[0m at [38;5;10m-O0[0m and [38;5;10m0xffc00000[0m at [38;5;10m-O1[0m/[38;5;10m-O2[0m/[38;5;10m-O3[0m/[38;5;10m-Os[0m — from identical source. It's register allocation, not semantics. I relaxed NaN comparison to class-equality and documented the measurement; everything else stays bit-exact, including [38;5;10m±0.0[0m, [38;5;10minf[0m sign, and denormals.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m2. [38;5;10mc2GJK[0m with an out-of-range [38;5;10mC2_TYPE[0m can segfault the C.[22m [38;5;10mc2MakeProxy[0m's switch has no [38;5;10mdefault:[0m, so the C proceeds with an uninitialised stack [38;5;10mc2Proxy[0m. [38;5;10mc2Support[0m then loops [38;5;10mi < pA.count[0m on garbage and reads past [38;5;10mverts[8][0m. I reproduced SIGSEGV in ~1 run in 3 by dlopening the C [38;5;10m.so[0m from a driver that pre-dirties the stack frame, and it also surfaced spontaneously under [38;5;10m--test-threads=4[0m. There is nothing here to match, so that probe is [38;5;10m#[ignore][0md and recorded as UB rather than asserted on. [38;5;10mc2Collided[0m does guard its enum ([38;5;10mdefault: return 0[0m) and that guard is fully tested with values including [38;5;10m3[0m, [38;5;10m-1[0m, [38;5;10mi32::MAX[0m, [38;5;10mi32::MIN[0m.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1m3. Two of my own table claims were wrong and are corrected.[22m [38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m row 16 originally said a zero-area triangle reaches [38;5;10mc23[0m's interior branch with [38;5;10mdiv == 0[0m. It does not: [38;5;10mdiv == area²[0m, and a collinear triple always short-circuits into a vertex or edge branch first — verified over all integer collinear triples and 20M randomized f32 triples, zero counterexamples. The iteration cap (row 36) is likewise unreachable: the largest proxy has 4 vertices, so the [38;5;10mdup[0m break fires long before [38;5;10miter[0m hits 20 (observed max: 3). It is asserted as an invariant instead.[0m[0m
