One caveat on completeness: branch coverage is asserted rather than assumed — the tests fail if [38;5;10mc23[0m's 7 regions, [38;5;10mc2CircletoCapsule[0m's 3 regions, [38;5;10mc2GJK[0m's hit/midpoint/shrink outcomes, or the [38;5;10mcount==3[0m warm-cache path go unreached. But coverage of [3mvalue space[23m is sampling, not proof; the seeds are fixed so results are reproducible.[0m[0m
